      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, with different font sizes I can come up with a situation when we should continue trying to place en ellipsis even if it\u0027s longer than the entire line. Another font can be smaller and it will fit.\n(This is the difference between my approach and Safari; they take the very first font only).",
