      "writtenOn": "2023-02-13T16:04:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, but if the ellipsis is positioned on the left we have to draw it first and then the rest of the text; if it\u0027s on the right, then first goes the text and then the ellipsis. Look down and you will see the other case (line 1013). It probably does not matter but I prefer to place glyphs in the visual order and not to jump back and forth.",
      "parentUuid": "79946a1b_177909c1",
      "revId": "b91d9c0b36eb861bd9b6357cc7961aa3d3994ccd",
